cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use MultiSolid-CL in your research, please cite the software and
  record the version used. Also cite the scientific sources for the kinetics
  and property data used in your simulations.
type: software
title: MultiSolid-CL
authors:
  - name: MultiSolid-CL contributors
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: https://github.com/Griminir5/multisolid-CL
url: https://github.com/Griminir5/multisolid-CL
license: GPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  MultiSolid-CL simulates reactive packed beds, coupling gas flow, heat
  transfer, and chemical reactions. It provides a desktop application and
  command-line interface for individual simulations, parameter studies,
  and comparison of results. Chemistry plugins extend species, properties,
  and reaction kinetics, with a focus on chemical looping processes.
keywords:
  - reactive packed beds
  - chemical looping
  - reactor simulation
  - heat and mass transfer
  - reaction kinetics
